  "findings": [
    "QD Grip Pod shows a tier 3 ADS recoil reduction on BROD 3, EF88, M16A4, RPK-74M and VSSM. Alloy Vertical shows tier 2 on the same weapons. The displayed recoil amount cannot separate tier 2 from tier 3 on four of the five weapons; Control does.",
    "This agrees with the Frosty source operand recoil.ads.amountTier.add = 3 and recoil.hip.amountTier.add = 3 for QD Grip Pod on these weapons (reference-data/provenance/frosty-site-review-2026-09-07.json, docs/archive/FROSTY_SITE_REVIEW_2026-09-07.md) and with changelist 28877515.",
    "The site catalog uses tier 2 for QD Grip Pod on all weapons. The VSSM note that the extra tier manifests only on the VSSM was based on the 1.3.3.0 capture corpus and is superseded by these captures.",
    "Precision rises by 1 to 2 points per grip tier on these previews (VSSM 82, 84, 86, 87 for tiers 2 to 5)."
  ],
